  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AGLC Karakoro Goudjia Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The collective will promote local management of shared natural resources, in particular the woody and herbaceous land, as well as surface water, and develop these resources with a view to sustainable added value in order to improve the living conditions of its members. Specifically, the collective will produce, purchase, and market non-timber forest products, such as balanites fruit, gum Arabic, baobab leaf, and jujube fruit.</narrative>
  </description>
